## 3. Working Style Expected of an Agent

- Measure before you build. Diagnose before fixing.
- Say when a test asserted the wrong thing, rather than silently changing the assertion to match broken behavior.
- Report failures faithfully — a partial result is not a success.
- Prefer additive migrations and changes over destructive ones.

